        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Nada Surf, Shihad\n- Albums: The Stars Are Indifferent to Astronomy, The General Electric\n- People: Matthew Caws, Ira Elliot, Doug Gillard, Daniel Lorca\n- Places: United States, New Zealand\n- Topics: alternative rock, rock\n\nFacts:\n- Shihad are a rock band from New Zealand that formed in 1988.\n- In October 1999, Shihad released The General Electric as their fourth album.\n- Nada Surf are an American alternative rock band.\n- Nada Surf currently consists of Matthew Caws on guitar and vocals, Ira Elliot on drums, Doug Gillard on guitar, and Daniel Lorca on bass and backing vocals.\n- The Stars Are Indifferent to Astronomy is the sixth album by Nada Surf.",
